  "statuteText": "106-B:10 Disposition of Fees. –\n\nAny fee for the performance of an act in line of duty or reward for the apprehension or conviction of any person, for the recovery of any property, received by or payable to an employee, shall be paid by him to the director of motor vehicles who shall immediately forward the same to the state treasurer."
